			<item>
				<title>President’s Message on the ACPI Encyclopedia - 2026 Edition</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/publications/acpi-encyclopedia/acpi-encyclopedia-presidents-message/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/publications/acpi-encyclopedia/acpi-encyclopedia-presidents-message/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;presidents-message-about-the-revised--enlarged-edition-of-the-acpi-encyclopedia-of-philosophy&#34; class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;President’s Message about the Revised &amp;amp; Enlarged edition of the &lt;em&gt;ACPI Encyclopedia of Philosophy&lt;/em&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34; style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#presidents-message-about-the-revised--enlarged-edition-of-the-acpi-encyclopedia-of-philosophy&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;As President of the Association of Christian Philosophers of India (ACPI), I am privileged to present this Revised and Enlarged Edition of the &lt;em&gt;ACPI Encyclopedia of Philosophy&lt;/em&gt;, offered as a Golden Jubilee Souvenir marking fifty years of our Association (1976–2026). What began as a pioneering effort in 2010 has now matured into a more comprehensive three-volume work, reflecting the growth of philosophical inquiry among Christian thinkers in India and their sustained engagement with the wider intellectual world.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
